# Scholar Studio — Environment Variable Template
#
# Setup: Copy-Item .env.example .env  (PowerShell)
#        cp .env.example .env         (macOS/Linux)
#
# Only SCHOLAR_EMBEDDING_API_KEY is recommended. Everything else has defaults in
# scholar/config.py that match infra/scholar/compose.yml out of the box.
# Without the API key, RAG semantic search is disabled; all other features work.
#
# This file is git-ignored. NEVER commit real secrets.

# ── RAG Embedding API Key (RECOMMENDED) ───────────────
# Without this key, RAG semantic search is unavailable.
# Full-text search, graph analysis, and all skills still work normally.
# Get a free zhipu key at: https://bigmodel.cn/usercenter/apikeys
# Get an OpenAI key at:    https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#
# Provider options: zhipu (default) | openai
SCHOLAR_EMBEDDING_API_KEY=replace_with_your_api_key
# SCHOLAR_EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=zhipu      # uncomment to switch to openai
# SCHOLAR_EMBEDDING_MODEL=embedding-2   # openai: text-embedding-3-small
# SCHOLAR_EMBEDDING_DIM=1024            # openai: 1536

# ─── Database (OPTIONAL — defaults match docker-compose) ───
# Only uncomment if you changed passwords in infra/scholar/compose.yml.
# ⚠️  Must keep .env and the compose configuration in sync!
# SCHOLAR_PG_HOST=localhost
# SCHOLAR_PG_PORT=5433                   # docker-compose maps 5433:5432
# SCHOLAR_PG_NAME=scholar
# SCHOLAR_PG_USER=scholar
# SCHOLAR_PG_PASS=scholar2024
# SCHOLAR_NEO4J_URI=bolt://localhost:7687
# SCHOLAR_NEO4J_USER=neo4j
# SCHOLAR_NEO4J_PASS=scholar2024

# ─── Local Tools (OPTIONAL) ────────────────────────────────
# SCHOLAR_LATEX_CMD=pdflatex            # override if not on PATH
